# Publish the course page and the self-contained lecture notes only.
# Local authoring records, exams, attic files, agent data and editor state
# remain on disk but are outside this allowlist.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/note/

# Keep PDFs and every LaTeX dependency, including the shared preamble and
# Unit 12's supplementary exercise source. Build output stays ignored.
/note/*
!/note/Makefile
!/note/*.tex
!/note/unit[0-9][0-9].pdf
!/note/unit01-2up.pdf

# Editor lock/backup files can resemble source filenames.
**/.#*
**/#*#
**/*~
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
